        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doomspire</strong> is an epic, roguelike adventure card game set in the <strong>Doomspire</strong>, an ancient and cursed structure that spirals down into the abyss. Once a towering monument that pierced the heavens, the <strong>Doomspire</strong> now crumbles inward, its roots descending into darkness, where doom awaits all who descend. You will create your <strong>hero</strong> and venture deeper into the <strong>Doomspire</strong>, facing terrifying bosses, uncovering forgotten treasures, and battling for your very survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621050/extras/a74bb491703aa6eb8188ad5ac0987555.poster.avif?t=1764350545\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621050/extras/a74bb491703aa6eb8188ad5ac0987555.webm?t=1764350545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621050/extras/a74bb491703aa6eb8188ad5ac0987555.mp4?t=1764350545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every journey is unique, as the <strong>Doomspire</strong> is procedurally generated with new paths, dangers, and mysteries waiting to be discovered. Collect powerful <strong>cards</strong> and <strong>passive powers</strong>, build synergies, and adapt your strategies as you progress. But beware—the deeper you go, the darker and more perilous the journey becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Depths</strong>: Each run offers a <strong>new experience</strong>, with shifting paths, enemies, and treasures in the <strong>Doomspire</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621050/extras/11b233fc24a002ff4bb5efb81948cae7.poster.avif?t=1764350545\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621050/extras/11b233fc24a002ff4bb5efb81948cae7.webm?t=1764350545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621050/extras/11b233fc24a002ff4bb5efb81948cae7.mp4?t=1764350545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Deck-Building</strong>: Collect and craft a <strong>unique deck</strong> for your hero. Use synergies, abilities, and powerful cards to create your perfect strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621050/extras/ebd2046e3f68d6086bad9335d2cfccec.poster.avif?t=1764350545\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621050/extras/ebd2046e3f68d6086bad9335d2cfccec.webm?t=1764350545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621050/extras/ebd2046e3f68d6086bad9335d2cfccec.mp4?t=1764350545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sacrifice Mechanics</strong>: Trade <strong>HP</strong>, <strong>minions</strong>, and <strong>resources</strong> for greater power. Risk and reward play a key role in the <strong>Doomspire</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Fights</strong>: Confront powerful bosses, each with their own unique abilities and strategies. Overcome them to gain valuable rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621050/extras/409af7eee9adb38793c1c15e2792fbcd.poster.avif?t=1764350545\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621050/extras/409af7eee9adb38793c1c15e2792fbcd.webm?t=1764350545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621050/extras/409af7eee9adb38793c1c15e2792fbcd.mp4?t=1764350545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong>: Every descent into the <strong>Doomspire</strong> is different. With multiple builds, playstyles, and synergies to explore, no two runs are ever the same.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doomspire</strong> combines <strong>strategic deck-building</strong> with <strong>roguelike elements</strong>, where every choice matters. You’ll need to balance your resources, make tough decisions, and adapt to the ever-changing environment of the <strong>Doomspire</strong>. The core focus is on crafting <strong>powerful synergies</strong> between cards and managing <strong>sacrificial mechanics</strong>, allowing for highly dynamic gameplay and endless replayability.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doomspire</strong> is an epic, roguelike adventure card game set in the <strong>Doomspire</strong>, an ancient and cursed structure that spirals down into the abyss. Once a towering monument that pierced the heavens, the <strong>Doomspire</strong> now crumbles inward, its roots descending into darkness, where doom awaits all who descend. You will create your <strong>hero</strong> and venture deeper into the <strong>Doomspire</strong>, facing terrifying bosses, uncovering forgotten treasures, and battling for your very survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621050/extras/a74bb491703aa6eb8188ad5ac0987555.poster.avif?t=1764350545\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621050/extras/a74bb491703aa6eb8188ad5ac0987555.webm?t=1764350545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621050/extras/a74bb491703aa6eb8188ad5ac0987555.mp4?t=1764350545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every journey is unique, as the <strong>Doomspire</strong> is procedurally generated with new paths, dangers, and mysteries waiting to be discovered. Collect powerful <strong>cards</strong> and <strong>passive powers</strong>, build synergies, and adapt your strategies as you progress. But beware—the deeper you go, the darker and more perilous the journey becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Depths</strong>: Each run offers a <strong>new experience</strong>, with shifting paths, enemies, and treasures in the <strong>Doomspire</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621050/extras/11b233fc24a002ff4bb5efb81948cae7.poster.avif?t=1764350545\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621050/extras/11b233fc24a002ff4bb5efb81948cae7.webm?t=1764350545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621050/extras/11b233fc24a002ff4bb5efb81948cae7.mp4?t=1764350545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Deck-Building</strong>: Collect and craft a <strong>unique deck</strong> for your hero. Use synergies, abilities, and powerful cards to create your perfect strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621050/extras/ebd2046e3f68d6086bad9335d2cfccec.poster.avif?t=1764350545\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621050/extras/ebd2046e3f68d6086bad9335d2cfccec.webm?t=1764350545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621050/extras/ebd2046e3f68d6086bad9335d2cfccec.mp4?t=1764350545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sacrifice Mechanics</strong>: Trade <strong>HP</strong>, <strong>minions</strong>, and <strong>resources</strong> for greater power. Risk and reward play a key role in the <strong>Doomspire</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Fights</strong>: Confront powerful bosses, each with their own unique abilities and strategies. Overcome them to gain valuable rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621050/extras/409af7eee9adb38793c1c15e2792fbcd.poster.avif?t=1764350545\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621050/extras/409af7eee9adb38793c1c15e2792fbcd.webm?t=1764350545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621050/extras/409af7eee9adb38793c1c15e2792fbcd.mp4?t=1764350545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong>: Every descent into the <strong>Doomspire</strong> is different. With multiple builds, playstyles, and synergies to explore, no two runs are ever the same.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doomspire</strong> combines <strong>strategic deck-building</strong> with <strong>roguelike elements</strong>, where every choice matters. You’ll need to balance your resources, make tough decisions, and adapt to the ever-changing environment of the <strong>Doomspire</strong>. The core focus is on crafting <strong>powerful synergies</strong> between cards and managing <strong>sacrificial mechanics</strong>, allowing for highly dynamic gameplay and endless replayability.</p>",
        "short_description": "Descend into the Doomspire, a fast-paced roguelike deckbuilder where every run is different. Build wild synergies, battle unique bosses, and push deeper into the tower. Easy to pick up, endlessly replayable, and built for players who love strategy with chaos.",
